348fa7fa029","name":"zhang-junming21","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/aa/ad/a482aad93ee6a7df064194c83e22353ea06f82b6f0e62d9533b1656a04c03194.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hid54649903"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166605526,"discussion_id":"3eaa0f416cfcedc1c35a674e23dc4fa8f879e653","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复量化批处理矩阵乘法（quant_batch_matmul_v3）内核中，当输入张量A采用NZ格式时，计算其内存偏移量（offsetA_）所使用的批次偏移变量错误。该错误导致在特定条件下访问了错误的输入数据批次，可能引发计算结果错误或内存访问越界。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`CalcOffset`函数中，针对输入张量A的NZ格式（包括转置和非转置两种情况）的内存偏移计算逻辑，将原本错误使用的`batchBOffset`变量统一更正为`batchAOffset`变量。这一修改确保了在计算张量A的全局内存地址时，使用的是与张量A自身批次维度（`batchA_`）相对应的正确批次索引，从而保证了数据访问的正确性。","created_at":"2026-03-27T14:38:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-27T14:38:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166605605,"discussion_id":"85ae8139a9f135726f1d91029f445456a16088f0","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=c606fbf40b2f43c3b1afd7b84d65ea85&projectName=CANN'>c606fbf40b2f43c3b1afd7b84d65ea85</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_81ff767ffbd64aa6899266201fd45d54/fb68deb6db12ad604fadbc412568ee58?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n     